WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.931
A letter home from school is the classic piece of admin: a date, a cost, a deadline.

00:00:04.931 --> 00:00:07.924
I open Quick add and give it a photo of the letter.

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:09.920
The photo is read, and never kept.

00:00:10.523 --> 00:00:11.550
It finds two things.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:20.843
The trip goes on the calendar for Leo, from quarter past nine to three, and the twelve pounds becomes a cost coming up, due on the sixth of November, with nobody down to pay it yet.

00:00:23.376 --> 00:00:27.064
I approve each one on its own, because there is no approve all.

00:00:27.064 --> 00:00:30.576
The trip joins the calendar, and the cost waits for a payer.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:34.946
Next, a note that says Sam paid forty dollars for ballet shoes.

00:00:34.946 --> 00:00:38.472
Expenses are in pounds, so nothing is converted or guessed.

00:00:38.472 --> 00:00:41.700
The card is blocked until I say what it was in pounds.

00:00:42.303 --> 00:00:48.463
It came to thirty-two pounds on the card statement, so I change the amount, choose pounds, and approve it.

00:00:49.848 --> 00:00:52.987
Bank statements are the other place shared costs hide.

00:00:52.987 --> 00:00:55.021
I upload last month's Monzo export.

00:00:55.021 --> 00:01:01.648
A parser written for that bank reads it, money in is dropped, and every row is kept only as a one-way fingerprint.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:07.401
The model sees only the merchant, the amount and the date, plus what this family already shares.

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:11.050
Out of twenty-four payments it suggests four, and says why for each.

00:01:11.653 --> 00:01:14.073
I turn the Clarks shoes into an expense.

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:21.453
It is already filled in as Mia's school shoes, paid by me and split evenly, and Sam sees the expense, never the statement.

00:01:22.056 --> 00:01:26.736
Uploading the same statement again adds nothing, because every row it holds has been seen before.

00:01:29.091 --> 00:01:32.620
On Sam's side, everything I approved is waiting to be agreed.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:36.091
None of the statement was shared, only the one cost I chose.

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:44.438
That was Quick add and statement import in CoParent: a photo, a note and a bank export turned into suggestions.

00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:49.957
The AI does the reading and the typing, and nothing changes until a parent approves it.
